    <detaileddescription>
<para>The typical use of this class is: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">class<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">CompositeFoo<sp/>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">public</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>Composite&lt;Foo&gt;<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
